<title>NEW ZEALAND: Utilicorp NZ declares 45 pct interest in Power NZ.</title>
<headline>Utilicorp NZ declares 45 pct interest in Power NZ.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Utilicorp NZ said in a notice to the New Zealand Stock Exchange on Wednesday that it had raised its relevant interest in Power New Zealand Ltd to 45.03 percent from 43.79 percent.</p>
<p>Utilicorp NZ is 79 percent owned by Utilicorp United Inc and is involved in a takeover battle with Auckland-based Mercury Energy for Power NZ.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 473-4746</p>
</text>
